    "turns": [
        {
            "role": "N",
            "text": "为什么「SNARC」会成为人工智能史上值得单独记住的一步？",
            "sourceIds": [],
            "claimIds": [],
            "contentOrigin": "editorial-hook"
        },
        {
            "role": "N",
            "text": "SNARC 是马文·明斯基和迪恩·埃德蒙兹建造的早期随机神经模拟强化计算机。它用模拟突触和奖励驱动行为来建模老鼠学习迷宫的过程。",
            "sourceIds": ["source-snarc-history-overview"],
            "claimIds": ["claim-legacy-achievement-summary", "claim-legacy-description"],
            "contentOrigin": "commentarySections.historical-background"
        },
        {
            "role": "N",
            "text": "模拟老鼠接收强化信号，并改变穿越迷宫的路径偏好。",
            "sourceIds": ["source-snarc-history-overview"],
            "claimIds": ["claim-legacy-achievement-summary", "claim-legacy-description"],
            "contentOrigin": "commentarySections.core-idea"
        },
        {
            "role": "N",
            "text": "专家通常把 SNARC 视为具有历史意义的早期神经硬件，尽管它并不是可扩展的通用 AI 系统。它的长期影响在于很早就展示了学习、奖励和神经式机器可以结合到一个物理装置中。",
            "sourceIds": ["source-snarc-history-overview"],
            "claimIds": ["claim-legacy-achievement-summary", "claim-legacy-description"],
            "contentOrigin": "commentarySections.long-term-legacy"
        },
        {
            "role": "N",
            "text": "当今天的系统规模越来越大时，「SNARC」留下的思路还有哪些价值，又有哪些边界值得重新追问？",
